The UN/EDIFACT directory is not part of this package or this repository. The package reads the archive each user
downloads from UNECE (https://unece.org/trade/uncefact/unedifact/download), unmodified; the directory is © United
Nations and licensed by the UN on the terms of the license agreement inside the archive (LICENAGR.TXT).

The test fixtures under samples/ are the published packages of the eight models of the business documents library and
293 records generated by HalvorsenDemo (https://github.com/SemanticDataCharter/HalvorsenDemo, Apache 2.0);
tests/golden/ holds five DESADV interchanges written from those records by the UN-EDIFACT library's DESADV writer. The
companies and documents are fictitious.

The tests use pydifact (https://github.com/nerdocs/pydifact, MIT) as an independent parser.
